        "say": "Four worked rows. A falling teenage licence rate means growth must come from corporate fleet training. Higher deposit rates mean dropping zero percent financing on mid-range models. Tightening rules on environmental claims mean every green claim needs evidence on file. Normalised grocery delivery among over-sixties means testing a delivery-first offer.",
        "cap": "Compare these with *inflation affects consumer spending*. Each row names something specific, says which way it is moving, and ends in something a person can be held to."
